From: NBOSP <nbosp@localhost>
Subject: [PATCH] Enable wlroots debug logging at runtime via CAGE_DEBUG

Release builds of Cage hard-code WLR_ERROR, which hides renderer selection,
dmabuf format and Xwayland startup messages. Honour CAGE_DEBUG so the NBOSP
GL debug mode can turn debug logging on without a debug build.
---
diff --git a/cage.c b/cage.c
index 26ab9ef..8cd5a9f 100644
--- a/cage.c
+++ b/cage.c
@@ -291,7 +291,7 @@ main(int argc, char *argv[])
 #ifdef DEBUG
 	wlr_log_init(WLR_DEBUG, NULL);
 #else
-	wlr_log_init(WLR_ERROR, NULL);
+	wlr_log_init(getenv("CAGE_DEBUG") != NULL ? WLR_DEBUG : WLR_ERROR, NULL);
 #endif
 
 	/* Wayland requires XDG_RUNTIME_DIR to be set. */
